ur teacher.<br>Defeat is still your reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But now\u2026<br>every step forward can be kept.<br>Every achievement can endure time.<br>And every failure can be relived with surgical clarity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome back to the cycle.<br>It hasn\u2019t become easier.<br>It has only become <strong>deeper</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Minutes: Echo of Persistence</strong><br>Continue. Suffer. Record your fall.<br>And try, once again, to reach the unreachable.</p>","developers":["Djully araujo","Christian tavares da silva"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4039470","name":"5 minutes"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4098950/b12ee3b84a1b75b52547eb722fca7c135aefec2a/header.jpg?t=1762807244","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"5 minutes- DLC 2","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"5 minutes- DLC 2 - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$1.99</span> $1.19 USD","packageid":1436508,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-40% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":119}],"title":"Buy 5 minutes- DLC 2"}],"packages":[1436508],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":40,"final":119,"final_formatted":"$1.19 USD","initial":199,"initial_formatted":"$1.99"},"publishers":["Kangelgames"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}